---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="fr">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow,noarchive" />
    <title>Commencer Esprit Subconscient 2.0</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Commence Esprit Subconscient 2.0 aujourd’hui avec un échéancier fixe et clairement annoncé."
    />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="preload" href="/fonts/inter-latin.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin />
    <script is:inline src="https://js.stripe.com/basil/stripe.js"></script>
  </head>

  <body>
    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="ambient ambient--one"></div>
        <div class="ambient ambient--two"></div>

        <div class="page-countdown shell" role="timer" aria-label="Temps restant : une heure">
          <div class="page-countdown__digits" aria-hidden="true">
            <div><strong>00</strong><small>jours</small></div>
            <b>:</b>
            <div><strong id="countdown-hours">01</strong><small>heure</small></div>
            <b>:</b>
            <div><strong id="countdown-minutes">00</strong><small>minutes</small></div>
            <b>:</b>
            <div><strong id="countdown-seconds">00</strong><small>secondes</small></div>
          </div>
          <div class="page-countdown__progress" aria-hidden="true">
            <span id="countdown-progress"></span>
          </div>
          <span class="page-countdown__note">Après le compteur, ce tarif ne sera plus disponible.</span>
        </div>

        <div class="shell hero-grid" id="top">
          <div class="hero-copy">
            <p class="eyebrow"><span></span> Réservé aux participants de la masterclass</p>
            <h1>
              Commence ta transformation
              <em>aujourd’hui pour 47&nbsp;€.</em>
            </h1>
            <p class="hero-lead">
              Tu n’as pas besoin de décider si tu es capable de tout changer.
              Tu dois juste faire le premier pas.
            </p>

            <section class="offer-summary" aria-labelledby="offer-summary-title">
              <div class="offer-summary__head">
                <span>Ce que tu rejoins</span>
                <h2 id="offer-summary-title">Esprit Subconscient 2.0</h2>
              </div>
              <div class="offer-summary__visual">
                <img
                  src="/media/pages/es2-bundle.webp"
                  alt="Esprit Subconscient 2.0 avec la formation, Morpho et la communauté Volt"
                />
              </div>
              <div class="offer-summary__details">
                <p><span>✓</span> Un cursus guidé sur 6 mois</p>
                <p><span>✓</span> 5 modules progressifs</p>
                <p><span>✓</span> Plus de 36 heures de formation</p>
                <p><span>✓</span> 15 minutes de pratique par jour</p>
                <p><span>✓</span> 12 mois d’accès à Morpho</p>
                <p><span>✓</span> Un bilan personnalisé à J+30</p>
                <p><span>✓</span> 60 jours d’accompagnement guidé</p>
                <p><span>✓</span> La communauté Volt</p>
                <p><span>✓</span> Toutes les mises à jour à vie</p>
              </div>
            </section>

            <button type="button" class="reviews-summary" id="open-reviews" aria-haspopup="dialog">
              <span class="reviews-summary__eyebrow">Avis des participants</span>
              <span class="reviews-summary__main">
                <span class="reviews-summary__score">4,8<small>/5</small></span>
                <span class="reviews-summary__rating">
                  <span class="star-meter" aria-label="Note moyenne : 4,8 sur 5">
                    <span aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</span>
                    <span aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</span>
                  </span>
                  <strong>61 avis clients</strong>
                  <small>48 avis 5 étoiles · 13 avis 4 étoiles</small>
                </span>
              </span>
              <span class="reviews-summary__footer">
                <span class="reviews-summary__avatars" aria-hidden="true">
                  <img src="https://files.elfsightcdn.com/eafe4a4d-3436-495d-b748-5bdce62d911d/7a97c502-a682-47a4-aec4-2aa2ac563908/malika-modified.png" alt="" />
                  <img src="https://files.elfsightcdn.com/eafe4a4d-3436-495d-b748-5bdce62d911d/e825f3b3-c3b4-49a5-9b69-7c2213b33a11/Melyssa.jpg" alt="" />
                  <img src="https://files.elfsightcdn.com/eafe4a4d-3436-495d-b748-5bdce62d911d/b94c69cf-4317-41b0-9637-3f8b8b3d6f52/1-1-.png" alt="" />
                </span>
                <strong>Lire leurs témoignages <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></strong>
              </span>
            </button>
          </div>

          <aside class="order-card" aria-labelledby="order-title">
            <div class="order-head">
              <p class="order-kicker">Ton accès à Esprit Subconscient 2.0</p>
              <h2 id="order-title">Commence maintenant</h2>
              <div class="today-price">
                <span class="today-price__amount">47&nbsp;€</span>
                <span class="today-price__label">aujourd’hui</span>
              </div>
              <p class="access-line"><span></span> Accès envoyé immédiatement après validation</p>
            </div>

            <form class="order-form" id="checkout-form" data-stripe-checkout>
              <div class="contact-grid">
                <label>
                  <span>Prénom</span>
                  <input type="text" id="customer-first-name" name="firstName" autocomplete="given-name" placeholder="Ton prénom" required />
                </label>
                <label>
                  <span>Email</span>
                  <input type="email" id="customer-email" name="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="ton@email.com" required />
                </label>
              </div>

              <div class="payment-preview" aria-label="Paiement sécurisé par Stripe">
                <div class="payment-preview__head">
                  <span>Paiement</span>
                  <span class="cards">VISA&nbsp;&nbsp; ●● &nbsp;&nbsp;Pay</span>
                </div>
                <div class="payment-loading" id="payment-loading"><span></span>Connexion sécurisée à Stripe…</div>
                <div id="stripe-payment-element" data-stripe-payment-element hidden></div>
                <div id="payment-preview-local" hidden></div>
                <p class="stripe-error" id="stripe-error" data-stripe-error role="alert"></p>
              </div>

              <section class="schedule" aria-labelledby="schedule-title">
                <div class="schedule-title-row">
                  <h3 id="schedule-title">Ton échéancier complet</h3>
                  <span>Fixe et sans surprise</span>
                </div>
                <div class="schedule-row schedule-row--active">
                  <div><span class="timeline-dot"></span><strong>Aujourd’hui</strong></div>
                  <strong>47&nbsp;€</strong>
                </div>
                <div class="schedule-row">
                  <div><span class="timeline-dot"></span><span>Dans 14 jours, le <b id="next-date">21 août 2026</b></span></div>
                  <strong>150&nbsp;€</strong>
                </div>
                <div class="schedule-row">
                  <div><span class="timeline-dot"></span><span>Puis 11 mensualités</span></div>
                  <strong>197&nbsp;€ / mois</strong>
                </div>
                <div class="schedule-total">
                  <span>Prix total de la commande</span>
                  <strong>2&nbsp;364&nbsp;€</strong>
                </div>
                <p class="schedule-explainer">
                  Les 47&nbsp;€ et 150&nbsp;€ constituent ensemble la première échéance de 197&nbsp;€.
                  Il ne s’agit pas d’un abonnement résiliable chaque mois&nbsp;: les mensualités
                  échelonnent le paiement d’un achat unique. Tes droits légaux éventuels restent applicables.
                </p>
              </section>

              <label class="consent">
                <input type="checkbox" id="commitment" required />
                <span class="custom-checkbox" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
                <span>
                  J’accepte les CGV.
                </span>
              </label>

              <button type="submit" class="buy-button" id="buy-button" disabled>
                <span>Payer 47&nbsp;€ et commencer maintenant</span>
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6" /></svg>
              </button>
              <p class="payment-obligation">Commande avec obligation de paiement</p>

              <div class="trust-row">
                <span>🔒 Paiement chiffré</span>
                <span>Accès immédiat</span>
                <span>Support humain</span>
              </div>
              <p class="legal-note">
                Tes droits légaux restent applicables dans les conditions prévues par les
                <a href="/conditions-utilisation/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CGV</a> et notre
                <a href="/confidentialite/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">politique de confidentialité</a>.
              </p>
            </form>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <p>© {currentYear} Sonny Court — Paiement sécurisé par Stripe.</p>
    </footer>

